<title>UK: BNG sets $200 million two-year bond.</title>
<headline>BNG sets $200 million two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Goldman Sachs.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANK NEDERLANDSE GEMEENTEN</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.125     MATURITY    28.JUL.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.955   PAY DATE    28.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.125     REOFFER    99.955    SPREAD	+2 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMS US/UK/JP/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.0 PCT JUNE 1999 U.S.T.  NOTES	UNSECURED AND UNSUBORDINATED.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
